00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:07,300
Daniel is listening to a program about Indian rhinos.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:12,260
Listen with him and then complete the notes below.

4
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:17,680
For thousands of years, Indian rhinos have lived in Asia.

5
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:27,210
Sadly, by 1975, there were only about 600 of them in the wild in the north of India and Nepal.

6
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:34,400
The governments of both countries decided to do something to increase the number of rhinos.

7
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:39,960
They made laws to stop people from hunting the rhinos for their horns.

8
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:46,840
In 2022, the number of wild Indian rhinos was over 4,000.
